<title>UK: ING sets 1.0 billion Czech crown one-year bond.</title>
<headline>ING sets 1.0 billion Czech crown one-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager ING Barings.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ING BANK NV</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN CZK   COUPON     10.50     MATURITY    04.MAR.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.80    PAY DATE    04.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.0	 REOFFER    99.95     SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    LUX AMS   PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   DENOMS (K) 25-50   SALE LIMITS US/UK/NL/CZ</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.15	SELL CONC  0.85	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
